# Data Directory

This folder contains input data for the project.

**Note:** Data files are not committed to git for privacy and size reasons.

## Expected Structure:
```
data/
├── raw/
│   ├── mix/         # PDF files to process
│   └── *.pdf        # Individual PDF files
└── SBB-Objecten-met-plaatscode-2023.xlsx  # Reference spreadsheet
```

## Setup:
1. Place your PDF files in `data/raw/mix/`
2. Ensure you have the Excel reference file if needed

Data files are excluded in `.gitignore`.
